      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good baseline. I'm seeing some weird data points in the sensor logs though. In a few of the high-load test runs, the thermal gradient fluctuates wildly and sporadically, almost as if the heat is being applied in inconsistent, unpredictable bursts rather than a smooth curve. It's like the heat management is just... not behaving normally under those specific conditions. Do you have any theories on what might cause that kind of erratic thermal behavior in the rotor?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
